<p>Any time you do not have an opponent in a square adjacent to you, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.5, 2.8, 4.0, 5.0, 6.0</acronym> Stamina regeneration. At talent level 3 or more, you also gain an equal amount of life regen when Breathing Room is active.</p>